    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that coupling a local hydrological model with a global glacier model and a snow redistribution scheme provides more reliable estimates of snow and glacier melt contributions by preventing compensatory errors, despite slightly lower streamflow performance metrics compared to uncoupled models.",
