            "paragraph": "For this study, we emulate the HBV (Hydrologiska Byr\u00e5ns Vattenbalansavdelning) model, a conceptual precipitation- streamflow model (Bergstr\u00f6m, 1995). HBV is widely applied in mountainous catchments and includes a simple glacier melt parameterization, making it well-suited for comparing simulated glacier melt between its native glacier module and GloGEM.",
