            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "The snow routine determines whether precipitation falls as rain or snow according to a temperature threshold (fRAINSNOW_TEMP). Snowmelt is modeled using a modified degree-day method where the melt factor (fMELT_FACTOR) varies seasonally between minimum and maximum values and is adjusted for forest cover and terrain aspect.",
